OL,3,GNEWSAThe 90-year-old still hitting the
OL,4,Agym every day
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost 90-year-olds might be expected to
OL,7,Fslow down a little. Not Tom Conroy.
OL,9,FThe grandfather still spends an hour
OL,10,Fand a half in the gym every day, heads
OL,11,Fout for three daily walks and often
OL,12,Fleaves walkers decades younger than him
OL,13,Fstruggling to keep up.
OL,15,F"'Use it or lose it' is a phrase he
OL,16,Fuses quite a lot," said his son,
OL,17,FStephen.
OL,19,FFor Tom, staying active has never just
OL,20,Fbeen about keeping fit. It has shaped
OL,21,Fmuch of his life.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
